[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3908479678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-3908479678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":3908479678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o9qq-","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T13:22:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T13:22:03Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nAs an alternative: when the user wants to make a screenshot, the developer could create a secondary camera positioned at the HMD (or some offset) and a sub-viewport using the main viewport's `World3D` that only renders once (`UPDATE_ONCE`).\r\n\r\nThe downside with that approach is that you'd render everything twice on one frame, and the secondary camera wouldn't have the exact same projection as either of the eyes being rendered for the HMD. The upside being that no changes would be required to the renderer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3908479678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909728273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-3909728273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":3909728273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pCbgR","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T17:35:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T17:35:15Z","body":"That is an unreasonable amount of overhead for something so simple. Also the chance that what is in eye being rendered different than a non VR camera is huge and very bug prone.\r\n\r\nSpectator cameras are a valid workflow for other cases but this is not what this change is addressing. It is a bout capturing with minimal overhead and changes the thing being displayed in headset.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909728273/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972046912","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-3972046912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":3972046912,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7swKBA","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T10:22:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T10:22:43Z","body":"Yeah this has been blocked by #116454 getting push in ahead of it.\r\n\r\nWould like to have had a chat @akien-mga esp as cyclic dep with XR interface was a call out point and this code has been stale for a while so assume this was one of the things which highlighted it. OpenXR is very much designed to get its hands into the render side by the spec. As its responsible for setting up the rendering context.\r\n\r\nUnlikely to have time to update this on main in the near future as our studio needs are met and this requires a rework for main. \r\n\r\nI think it is safe to assume that OpenXRInterface::post_draw_viewport will want to screw with the compositor post frame draw as there are a bunch of XR specific viewport elements which can happen. Esp on devices like some consoles which have a more baked in social screen concept and the additional viewport approach which is favour in some cases adds a lot of latency.\r\n\r\n\r\nAnyway open to suggestions for changes but unlikely to have time at present. Also dissapointed I didn't see any conversation on this PR regards to it or any mention of the that PR in the XR chat as it does seem to hit a bunch of XR files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972046912/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4140377982","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-4140377982","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":4140377982,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72ySd-","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T05:54:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T05:54:37Z","body":"Code wise this looks great. I do think there is still some discussion to be had because at the core, we're working around a shortcoming of the override logic the renderer. That said, to my knowledge we don't have a solution to trigger capturing the frame output at the end of rendering and I can see that other devs might want to have access to that as well.\r\n\r\nSo I'm still on the fence whether the right way forward is to rework the way we do the color override so that we can properly use `ViewportTextures` to access the data, and in doing so use the existing capabilities, or if we should take this solution a little further and make it a proper feature of the renderer so non-XR users can make use of it too.\r\n\r\nNote that for the `ViewportTexture` work there is an outstanding PR that solves this for Vulkan, but is running in some snags for DX and Metal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4140377982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4358397771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-4358397771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":4358397771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA8ffSw","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T07:53:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T07:53:07Z","body":"Will be poking at this on the weekend. Not tested latest code fully yet, should all be good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4358397771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4359029336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116314#issuecomment-4359029336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116314","id":4359029336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA9GCWA","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users